    "一覧に九星気学の本命星を表示します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows the 本命星 (honmeisei) star from 九星気学 nine-star astrology."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一覧に前厄・本厄・後厄を表示します。性別が未指定の場合は表示されません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows 厄年 (yakudoshi) unlucky years — 前厄 before, 本厄 main, and 後厄 after. Nothing is shown while gender is unspecified, as the ages differ by gender."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一覧に表示する": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show in the list"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一覧に還暦、古希、喜寿などの長寿祝いを表示します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows 賀寿 (gaju) longevity celebrations such as 還暦 (kanreki, 60), 古希 (koki, 70), and 喜寿 (kiju, 77)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一覧の各年に干支を絵文字と漢字で表示します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows the 干支 (eto) zodiac sign for each year as an emoji and kanji."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一覧の年齢は満年齢（誕生日ごとに1つ増える、現在ふつうに使われている数え方）で表示します。オンにすると、年の詳細などに数え年も添えます。数え年は生まれた時点で1歳とし、以後は元日ごとに1つ増える昔ながらの数え方で、年内では満年齢より1つ多くなります。還暦や喜寿などの長寿祝い、厄年は、もともと数え年で見るものです。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ages in the list are counted the modern way, increasing on each birthday. Turn this on to also show kazoedoshi, the traditional count, in the year detail and elsewhere. Kazoedoshi treats a newborn as one year old and adds a year every New Year's Day, so within a year it is one more than the modern count. Longevity celebrations such as kanreki and kiju, and the unlucky yakudoshi years, are traditionally reckoned this way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "三越の前身である越後屋が江戸に開店し、現金正価販売という新しい商法を始めました。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Echigoya — the shop that would become the Mitsukoshi department store — opened in Edo, pioneering fixed prices and cash sales."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "九星": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "九星の中央に位置する星で、五行は土にあたります。他の八星すべてを従える定位置を持たない星とされ、良くも悪くも力が強く、中心に立つ性質とされます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The star at the centre of the nine, belonging to earth. Having no fixed position of its own, it is said to command the other eight — a strong force for good or ill, and one that ends up at the centre of things."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "九星の最初の星で、五行は水にあたります。水が高い所から低い所へ流れ、器に合わせて形を変えるように、周りに合わせて柔らかく動きながら、深く考える性質とされます。方位では北を司ります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first of the nine stars, belonging to water. As water runs from high ground to low and takes the shape of whatever holds it, this star is said to adapt softly to its surroundings while thinking deeply. It governs the north."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "九星の最後の星で、五行は火にあたります。太陽や炎のように明るく人目を引き、物事をはっきりと照らし出す性質とされます。方位では南を司ります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The last of the nine stars, belonging to fire. Like the sun or a flame it is bright and draws the eye, showing things up clearly. It governs the south."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "九星気学は、生まれた年によって九つの星のいずれかに分ける占いです。一白水星から九紫火星まであり、9年で一巡します。\n\n星は立春（2月4日ごろ）を境に変わるため、1月1日から立春の前日までに生まれた人は、前の年の星になります。\n\nそれぞれの星には木・火・土・金・水の五行が結びつけられ、性格や相性、その年の運勢を見るときの目安として使われます。方角の吉凶を見る「方位学」でも用いられます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kyūsei kigaku sorts people into nine stars according to their birth year, from Ippaku Suisei to Kyūshi Kasei, cycling every nine years.\n\nThe star changes at risshun, the start of spring around 4 February — so anyone born between 1 January and the day before risshun belongs to the previous year's star.\n\nEach star is tied to one of the five phases (wood, fire, earth, metal, water) and is consulted for character, compatibility and the fortunes of a given year. The same system underlies hōigaku, the reading of lucky and unlucky directions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五行は土": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Earth among the five phases"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五行は土にあたります。動かない山にたとえられ、粘り強く、変化の節目に立つ性質とされます。方位では北東を司ります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An earth star, likened to an unmoving mountain: persistent, and standing at the turning points of change. It governs the north-east."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五行は土にあたります。畑の土のように、時間をかけて物事を育てる働きとされ、地道な努力と面倒見のよさが持ち味とされます。方位では南西を司ります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An earth star. Like soil in a field, it is said to bring things along slowly, its strengths being steady effort and care for others. It governs the south-west."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五行は木": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wood among the five phases"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五行は木にあたります。同じ木でも、風に揺れて伸びていく樹木にたとえられ、人との縁を広げ、信用を積み重ねる性質とされます。方位では南東を司ります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also a wood star, but likened to a tree swaying in the wind as it grows — widening its connections and building trust over time. It governs the south-east."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五行は木にあたります。春に草木が勢いよく芽吹く姿にたとえられ、若々しく行動が早い性質とされます。雷の象意も持ちます。方位では東を司ります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A wood star, likened to plants bursting into leaf in spring: youthful and quick to act. It also carries the image of thunder. It governs the east."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五行は水": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Water among the five phases"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五行は火": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fire among the five phases"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五行は金": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Metal among the five phases"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五行は金にあたります。同じ金でも、実った作物や装飾品にたとえられ、人を楽しませる愛嬌と社交性が持ち味とされます。方位では西を司ります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also a metal star, but likened to ripened crops and ornaments — charming, sociable, and good at giving others pleasure. It governs the west."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五行は金にあたります。天の働きや、鍛えられた金属にたとえられ、筋を通す強さと責任感が持ち味とされます。方位では北西を司ります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A metal star, likened to the workings of heaven and to tempered metal: principled, strong and responsible. It governs the north-west."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今年の元日で数え%@歳です\n今年の誕生日で満%@歳になりました": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ by the traditional count since New Year's Day\nTurned %@ on this year's birthday"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今年の元日で数え%@歳です\n今年の誕生日で満%@歳になります\n今日は誕生日前なので満%@歳です": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ by the traditional count since New Year's Day\nTurning %@ on this year's birthday\nStill %@ until then"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今年の元日で数え%lld歳\n今年の誕生日で満%lld歳\nになる方の誕生年です": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
