          }
        }
      }
    },
    "災いが多いとされる年齢": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ages said to attract misfortune"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "牛": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ox"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "特大": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Extra Large"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "犬": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dog"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "猪": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Boar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "猿": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Monkey"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "生まれた年の干支に還ることから。十干十二支は60年で一巡し、数え61歳でもとの干支に戻ります。赤いちゃんちゃんこを贈るのは、赤ん坊に還る意味と、赤が魔除けの色であることによります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Named for the return to the stem-branch of one's birth year: the sixty-year cycle completes, and the 61st year by the traditional count brings it back round. The red vest given on this occasion means both a return to infancy and the protective power of the colour red."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "生まれるまであと%lld年": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld years before birth"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "生まれ年で決まる九つの星": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nine stars, one for each birth year"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "生年月日をもとに、小学1年から大学4年までの学年を一覧に表示します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses the date of birth to show each grade from elementary school year 1 through university year 4."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用語の意味を見る": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show what this term means"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "由井正雪らによる幕府転覆の計画（慶安の変）が発覚しました。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A plot by Yui Shōsetsu and others to overthrow the shogunate — the Keian uprising — was uncovered."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "甲子（きのえね）の年は変革が起きるとされ、その災いを避けるために改元されました。1年ほどで終わった短い元号で、池田屋事件や禁門の変が起き、幕末の動乱が頂点に向かう時期にあたります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A kasshi year was believed to bring upheaval, and the era name was changed to ward off the associated calamities. It lasted only about a year: the Ikedaya and Kinmon incidents both fell in this period, as the turmoil of the late shogunate approached its peak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "男性": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Male"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "町人文化が円熟した時期です。貨幣の質を落としたことで経済が活気づき、化政文化と呼ばれる町人文化が栄えました。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A period in which townspeople's culture came to maturity. Debasing the currency stimulated the economy, and the merchant culture known as Kasei flourished."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "町人文化が花開いた元禄文化の時代です。松尾芭蕉、井原西鶴、近松門左衛門が活躍しました。赤穂浪士の討ち入りもこの時期です。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The age of Genroku culture, when the arts of the townspeople flowered. Matsuo Bashō, Ihara Saikaku and Chikamatsu Monzaemon were all at work, and the forty-seven rōnin took their revenge in this era."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面の明るさの見た目を決めます。自動を選ぶと、iPhone本体のライトモード・ダークモードの設定に合わせて変わります。ライトまたはダークを選ぶと、端末の設定に関わらずその見た目に固定されます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sets the app's appearance. Auto follows your iPhone's Light or Dark Mode setting. Light or Dark fixes the appearance regardless of your device setting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "目黒行人坂の大火などの災いに加え、「明和九年」が「迷惑」に通じることも嫌われて改元されました。杉田玄白らの「解体新書」が刊行され、蘭学が広まります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The era name was changed after disasters including the great fire at Meguro Gyōninzaka — and partly because “Meiwa 9” (meiwa-ku) sounded like meiwaku, “trouble.” Sugita Genpaku's Kaitai Shinsho, a translated anatomy text, was published, and Dutch learning spread."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移動": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jump"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移動先 西暦%@年": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
